# Benchmark view "balcony far" (tools/ai/README.md "Benchmark states"). Starts right after the village save has loaded (free control on
# the treehouse balcony, camera behind the hero looking down at the path). Frame-counted pad input with a fixed game step: the same
# game time and the same input on every run, whatever the fps.
@rate 60
30
# camera low behind the hero, pitched up: the view looks over the village into the distance (far trees, houses, sky)
stick right 0 1 for 45
30
@shot balcony_far
@rate 0
@log bench: balcony_far ready
